category: Clusters|Cameras
description: >
  Implementation of the AV Analysis Server Cluster.
  The user has to enable the AV Analysis Server Cluster in the ZCL Advanced Platform (ZAP) tool in order to enable this functionality.
id: matter_av_analysis
package: matter
label: AV Analysis Server Cluster
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: "Apache 2.0"
provides:
  - name: matter_av_analysis
source:
  - path: third_party/matter_sdk/src/app/clusters/av-analysis-server/AvAnalysisCluster.cpp
  - path: third_party/matter_sdk/src/app/clusters/av-analysis-server/AvAnalysisLogic.cpp
  - path: third_party/matter_sdk/src/app/clusters/av-analysis-server/CodegenIntegration.cpp
    unless: [matter_code_driven_dm]
include:
  - path: third_party/matter_sdk/src/app/clusters/av-analysis-server
    file_list:
      - path: AvAnalysisCluster.h
      - path: AvAnalysisLogic.h
      - path: AvAnalysisStorage.h
template_contribution:
  - name: component_catalog
    value: matter_av_analysis